{"id":50,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">قٓ</span>‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرْءَانِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"بَلْ عَجِب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ج</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نذ</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ِّنْهُمْ فَقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِرُونَ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا شَىْءٌ عَج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"أَءِذَا مِتْنَا وَكُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا تُرَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">بًا‌ۖ ذ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ رَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span><span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">عُۢ ب</span>َع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> عَلِمْنَا مَا تَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نق</span>ُصُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضُ مِنْهُمْ‌ۖ وَعِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َنَا كِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بٌ حَف<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>ظُۢ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"بَلْ كَذَّبُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ لَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا ج<span class=\"t