ي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٢</span>"},{"id":23,"tajweed":"وَقَالَ قَرِينُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا مَا لَدَىَّ عَت<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٣</span>"},{"id":24,"tajweed":"أَلْقِيَا فِى جَهَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَ كُلَّ كَفَّارٍ عَن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٤</span>"},{"id":25,"tajweed":"مَّ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">عٍ ل</span>ِّلْخَيْرِ مُعْتَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دٍ م</span>ُّر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٥</span>"},{"id":26,"tajweed":"ٱلَّذِى جَعَلَ مَعَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ إِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هًا ءَاخَرَ فَأَلْقِيَاهُ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَذَابِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٦</span>"},{"id":27,"tajweed":"۞ قَالَ قَرِينُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> رَبَّنَا م<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>غَيْتُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> وَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َانَ فِى ضَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">لِۭ ب</span>َع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٧</span>"},{"id":28,"tajweed":"قَالَ لَا تَخْتَصِمُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَدَىّ