ss=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>خُلُوهَا بِسَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مٍ‌ۖ ذ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ يَوْمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخُل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٤</span>"},{"id":35,"tajweed":"لَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّا يَش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُونَ فِيهَا وَلَدَيْنَا مَز<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٥</span>"},{"id":36,"tajweed":"وَكَمْ أَهْلَكْنَا قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لَه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َرْنٍ هُمْ أَشَدُّ مِنْه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">شًا ف</span>َنَقَّبُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>دِ هَلْ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّح<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>صٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٦</span>"},{"id":37,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ فِى ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ لَذِكْرَىٰ لِمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>َانَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> قَلْبٌ أَوْ أَلْقَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمْعَ وَهُوَ شَه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٧</span>"},{"id":38,"tajweed":"وَلَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">مٍ و</span>َمَا مَسَّنَا م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ِن ل</span>ُّغ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٨</span>"},{"id":39,"tajweed":"فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>صْبِرْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَقُولُونَ وَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لَ طُلُوعِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسِ وَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٩</span>"},{"id":40,"tajweed":"وَمِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ فَسَبِّحْهُ وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>بَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سُّج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٠</span>"},{"id":41,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَمِعْ يَوْمَ يُنَادِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُنَادِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّكَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نٍ ق</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span>ٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤١</span>"},{"id":42,"tajweed":"يَوْمَ يَسْمَعُونَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّيْحَةَ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ‌ۚ ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ يَوْمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْخُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ج</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٢</span>"},{"id":43,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا نَحْنُ نُحْى<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَنُمِيتُ وَإِلَيْنَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَص<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٣</span>"},{"id":44,"tajweed":"يَوْمَ تَشَقَّقُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضُ عَنْهُمْ سِرَا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">عًا‌ۚ ذ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ حَشْرٌ عَلَيْنَا يَس<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٤</span>"},{"id":45,"tajweed":"نَّحْنُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يَقُولُونَ‌ۖ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>َ عَلَيْه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ِم ب</span>ِجَبَّا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رٍ‌ۖ ف</span>َذَكِّرْ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرْءَانِ م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َخَافُ وَع<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">د</span>ِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٥</span>"}]}